  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Deadly Troupe",
    "definition_type_raw": "Teamwork",
    "source_book_raw": "Inner Sea Races pg. 204",
    "definition_raw": "Source Inner Sea Races pg. 204\nYou combine elements of dance and acting with your combat style to distract your enemies.\n\nPrerequisites: Perform (act) or Perform (dance) 3 ranks, human (Varisian).\n\nBenefit: When at least one ally who also has this feat is threatening a foe, you gain a +4 circumstance bonus against that foe on Bluff checks to feint, Bluff checks to create a diversion to hide, and Acrobatics checks to move through that foe’s threatened squares. You also gain a +2 circumstance bonus on steal and dirty trick combat maneuver checks made against that foe.",
